    <string name="location_rationale">Sail Logger collects location data to enable track logging even when the app is closed or not in use. This app logs your sailing session. It requires background location data to be logged. This is considered to be sensitive information and needs user approval. Data collected is exclusively written to the app folder on the device and cannot be accessed by authors or any third party. In next screen you will be asked to allow these permissions. Select \'Allow all the time\' to be able to use the app properly.</string>
